  "body": "Canvas hit regions add a `region` [member](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#dom-mouseevent-region) to `MouseEvent` and `Touch`.  Is it me, or is the generic nature of this name likely to be confusing (eg. does it have to do with CSS regions?).  Since nobody has (quite) shipped this API yet, perhaps we should consider making the name a bit more specific, eg. `canvasHitRegion`?\n\nNot a big deal, I can live with `region` but wanted to raise the question before blink ships, just in case others feel similarly.\n",
